    "storage": {
      "value": "<ac:layout><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"two_right_sidebar\"><ac:layout-cell><h2>Purpose and Benefits</h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">The CSV export feature is used for data migration to and from Bahmni. The user has to have app:admin privilege to&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">use this feature.</span></span></p><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Steps</span></h2><h3><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">1. Configure CSV Export Tab</span></h3><p>To make CSV export appear in the Admin module, add the following configuration to the extension.json file. The file can be found in the &quot;/config/openmrs/apps/admin/&quot; &nbsp;folder.</p><p>Modify the &quot;<strong>extension.json&quot;&nbsp;</strong>to contain the snippet below:</p><p><ac:image ac:width=\"700\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image2016-4-15 13:13:17.png\" /></ac:image></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"49e6792b-c5a0-4c9f-97e1-4fa9b43fd2b0\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"language\">js</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[\"csvExport\":{\n    \"id\": \"bahmni.admin.csvExport\",\n    \"extensionPointId\": \"org.bahmni.admin.dashboard\",\n    \"type\": \"link\",\n    \"extensionParams\": {\n    },\n    \"label\": \"CSV Export\",\n    \"url\": \"#/csvExport\",\n    \"icon\": \"fa-download\",\n    \"order\": 1,\n    \"requiredPrivilege\": \"app:registration\"\n},]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Key Fields&nbsp;</h2><table><tbody><tr><th>Key</th><th>Use</th><th>Mandatory</th></tr><tr><td><pre>url</pre></td><td>Points the app to the csv export state</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><pre>icon</pre></td><td>The icon that will be displayed on the button</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td><pre>label</pre></td><td>The text that will be rendered on the button</td><td>Yes</td></tr></tbody></table><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><br /></span></div></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"tip\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"e6921b04-2089-48cb-990e-45bb5d87af22\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"icon\">false</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">On this Page</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"toc\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"15ac3ed5-60b1-4a41-8b0c-9d8a1db9411b\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"style\">none</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"0add60ca-db50-405a-bfd6-90945fbc2b0b\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#668D3C</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Feature Details</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Data Migration - Export\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[CSV Export - Feature Guide]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link></span></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"b94e3ad7-5c3a-4de1-9e38-0d0d4195b78d\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#668D3C</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Usage Details</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Export Data\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[CSV Export - User Guide]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link></span></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section></ac:layout>",
