      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"ConfigureCSVExport-PurposeandBenefits\">Purpose and Benefits</h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">The CSV export feature is used for data migration to and from Bahmni. The user has to have app:admin privilege to <span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">use this feature.</span></span></p><h2 id=\"ConfigureCSVExport-Steps\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Steps</span></h2><h3 id=\"ConfigureCSVExport-1.ConfigureCSVExportTab\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">1. Configure CSV Export Tab</span></h3><p>To make CSV export appear in the Admin module, add the following configuration to the extension.json file. The file can be found in the &quot;/config/openmrs/apps/admin/&quot;  folder.</p><p>Modify the &quot;<strong>extension.json&quot; </strong>to contain the snippet below:</p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/53313573/image2016-4-15%2013:13:17.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460706200100&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=172\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/53313573/image2016-4-15%2013:13:17.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460706200100&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"53837896\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2016-4-15 13:13:17.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"53313573\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"7\" data-media-id=\"cf38a064-aa2b-4caf-95c3-24fad8607eb9\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/53313573/image2016-4-15%2013:13:17.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460706200100&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1400&amp;height=344 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/53313573/image2016-4-15%2013:13:17.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460706200100&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=172 1x\"></span></p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"49e6792b-c5a0-4c9f-97e1-4fa9b43fd2b0\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">&quot;csvExport&quot;:{\n    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;bahmni.admin.csvExport&quot;,\n    &quot;extensionPointId&quot;: &quot;org.bahmni.admin.dashboard&quot;,\n    &quot;type&quot;: &quot;link&quot;,\n    &quot;extensionParams&quot;: {\n    },\n    &quot;label&quot;: &quot;CSV Export&quot;,\n    &quot;url&quot;: &quot;#/csvExport&quot;,\n    &quot;icon&quot;: &quot;fa-download&quot;,\n    &quot;order&quot;: 1,\n    &quot;requiredPrivilege&quot;: &quot;app:registration&quot;\n},</pre>\n</div></div><p> </p><h2 id=\"ConfigureCSVExport-KeyFields\">Key Fields </h2><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"confluenceTable\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"confluenceTh\">Key</th><th class=\"confluenceTh\">Use</th><th class=\"confluenceTh\">Mandatory</th></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><pre>url</pre></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\">Points the app to the csv export state</td><td class=\"confluenceTd\">Yes</td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><pre>icon</pre></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\">The icon that will be displayed on the button</td><td class=\"confluenceTd\">No</td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><pre>label</pre></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\">The text that will be rendered on the button</td><td class=\"confluenceTd\">Yes</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><br/></span></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro has-no-icon confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"e6921b04-2089-48cb-990e-45bb5d87af22\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this Page</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-cssliststyle=\"none\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"15ac3ed5-60b1-4a41-8b0c-9d8a1db9411b\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div><p> </p></div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"0add60ca-db50-405a-bfd6-90945fbc2b0b\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Feature Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/53313626/Data+Migration+-+Export\" data-linked-resource-id=\"53313626\" data-linked-resource-version=\"4\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">CSV Export - Feature Guide</a></span></p>\n</div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"b94e3ad7-5c3a-4de1-9e38-0d0d4195b78d\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Usage Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/53313622/Export+Data\" data-linked-resource-id=\"53313622\" data-linked-resource-version=\"5\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">CSV Export - User Guide</a></span></p>\n</div></div><p> </p><p> </p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
